# Expense App Enhancements

## 1. Exchange Rate Display ✅

Tỉ giá VCB USD → VND hiển thị trên navbar, giống Invoice/Workforce.

## 2. Receipt File Upload → Cloudflare R2 ✅

Thay ô nhập URL bằng file upload qua Edge Function `r2-expense-upload`. File lưu trực tiếp lên **Cloudflare R2** (dùng credentials có sẵn).

- Hỗ trợ: PDF, JPG, PNG, WEBP (tối đa 10MB)
- Upload xong: hiện preview (ảnh thumbnail / icon PDF) + nút xoá
- Danh sách expense: hiện link 📎 "Xem hoá đơn"

![Expense form with R2 upload](file:///C:/Users/dangt/.gemini/antigravity/brain/c8091b7d-5055-460e-a9fd-6d2849cebec3/expense_add_form_initial_1773563763131.png)

### Files Changed

| File | Change |
|------|--------|
| [ExpenseApp.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/expense/components/ExpenseApp.tsx) | Added VCB exchange rate fetch |
| [ExpenseForm.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/expense/components/ExpenseForm.tsx) | File upload via R2 Edge Function |
| [ExpenseList.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/expense/components/ExpenseList.tsx) | Added 📎 receipt link on cards |

### Backend
- Deployed Edge Function `r2-expense-upload` (POST upload, DELETE remove)
- Uses existing R2 secrets: `R2_ACCOUNT_ID`, `R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID`, `R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`, `R2_BUCKET_NAME`, `R2_PUBLIC_URL`
- Files stored under `expense-receipts/` prefix in R2 bucket
